"loc": "B2 - HSSEQ Procedures §2.2.1.5 & B3 - Operational Manual",
"ans": "Only trained and designated personnel may operate lifting gear. All lifting equipment, wire ropes, and slings must have valid SWL marking, color coding, and undergo visual inspection prior to use. Damaged or uncertified lifting gear must be removed from service immediately.",
