"9.1.3": {
"q": "Were the Master, deck officers, and ratings involved with mooring operations, familiar with the content of the Line Management Plan and was the plan maintained in accordance with company instructions with mooring line, mooring tail and joining shackle certificates available for each item included within the Line Management Plan?",
"short": "Line Management Plan (LMP) implementation"
},
"9.1.4": {
"q": "Did all mooring lines, mooring tails and joining shackles, including those carried as spares, meet industry guidelines?",
"short": "Mooring lines, tails and mooring shackles",
"rating": {
"title": "MOORING LINES & TAILS / HALATLAR VE TAIL'LER",
"know": [
[
"Visually check lines/tails before use.",
"Kullanmadan önce halat/tail'i gözle kontrol et."
],
[
"Report cuts, abrasion, glazing, contamination or abnormal damage.",
"Kesik, aşınma, parlama, kirlenme veya anormal hasarı bildir."
],
[
"Keep clear of bights and identified snap-back/danger zones.",
"Halat bükümlerinden ve snap-back/tehlike bölgelerinden uzak dur."
]
],
"loc": "B3 - Operational Manual (Bridge & Deck) §2.10 & MEG4 Requirements",
"ans": "Treat every loaded line with extreme caution and stay clear of potential snap-back paths. Lines are inspected continuously before, during and after use for abrasion, glazing, diameter/colour/texture/stiffness changes. Company policy states mooring ropes/wires are renewed five years after entering service, subject also to condition/retirement criteria.",
"qEn": "What do you do if you find a damaged mooring line?",
"aEn": "I do not use it without assessment/authorization; I report the damage to the responsible officer.",
"qTr": "Hasarlı mooring halatı görürsen ne yaparsın?",
"aTr": "Değerlendirme/yetki olmadan kullanmam; hasarı sorumlu zabite bildiririm.",
"topicEn": "Mooring lines, tails and joining shackles, including spares, must meet the applicable industry requirements and be fit for use.",
"topicTr": "Mooring halatları, tail'ler ve bağlantı kilitleri, yedekler dahil, ilgili gereklere uygun ve kullanıma elverişli olmalıdır.",
"slogan": "DAMAGED LINE? REPORT - DO NOT IMPROVISE."
}
},
